        "url": "https://lagerland-apps.github.io/apps/earnlock/",
        "why": "Locks distracting apps (Instagram, TikTok, X, Reddit, YouTube, or any selection) until you hit a daily activity goal measured by Apple Health on the iPhone: steps free, active minutes or active calories with Premium. Half the goal opens them for an hour and the full goal until midnight. The first week is a Shadow Week that blocks nothing and counts how often you would have been blocked. A locked app shows what is left to earn (\"2,026 steps until unlock\"), and a math-gated emergency unlock (1/day) covers genuine needs. Locking one app is free for good; Premium is {P_MONTHLY@earnlock}/mo or {P_YEARLY@earnlock}/yr (each with a free trial) or {P_LIFETIME@earnlock} once, with Family Sharing on every paid plan. No account and no third-party SDKs; it is for limiting your own iPhone and has no parent controls."
