        "why": "Mac app for App Store screenshots (formerly ScreenFlow Studio): six 3D device models of iPhone, iPad, MacBook Pro, and Apple Watch, 50 App Store languages in one project with AI translation through your own key, and direct upload to App Store Connect. One-time {P_APP@mockly}, no subscription."
      },
      {
